# Form: archive / replacement frame

Use to withdraw or replace knowledge without losing origin/obligations. Default:
`docs/archive/<topic>.md` or a frame around an immutable external/history item.
Copy payload only; [metadata](../../references/metadata.md) is authoritative. Essential:
origin, historical scope, reason, replacement or explicit none, residual obligations.
For a whole replaced authored document, keep its ID/status at its existing address
as appropriate; this frame has its own ID if preserving an independent snapshot.
Set `snapshot_of` only for a known original ID. Remove irrelevant optional fields.
A new replacement declares `supersedes: [old-id]`; reciprocal human links must agree.
Do not edit immutable evidence or interpret archival as deletion authority.

